# The format of this file is identical to `.dockerignore`.
# It is used to reduce the size of deployed images to make the process of publishing faster.

# No need to store the pnpm store twice.
.local

# Claude Code credentials/state - must never ship in a deploy image.
.claude-home

# Headless Chromium and Playwright leftovers from UI checks in the workspace:
# gigabytes of throwaway browser profiles (each with dead SingletonSocket
# symlinks into /tmp) and browser downloads. Nothing in the deployment runs a
# browser. Shipping them pushed the image past what the deploy would create
# (2026-10-14: "Deployment container creation failed").
.cache/chromium-headless
.cache/ms-playwright
.cache/pnpm
.config/chromium-headless
.config/chromium
